@startuml
!pragma layout smetana
title Component Diagram - 004 Multi-Question Rounds & Teacher Question Board
left to right direction

actor Teacher
actor Student

package "Next.js App (Node.js runtime)" {
	component "Teacher Question Board\n(card list + sticky toolbar)" as BoardUI
	component "Student Open Questions\n(one card per open round)" as StudentUI
	component "Round State Reducer\n(pure, shared by both UIs)" as Reducer
	component "Student API Client\n(events URL + submit)" as StudentApi
	component "Open Route\nPOST rounds/open\n{questionNumbers[]} | {questionNumber}" as OpenAPI
	component "Close Route\nPOST rounds/{roundId}/close" as CloseAPI
	component "Close-All Route\nPOST rounds/close-all" as CloseAllAPI
	component "Submissions Route\nPOST rounds/{roundId}/submissions" as SubmitAPI
	component "Writeback Route\n(failed job can be re-queued)" as WritebackAPI
	component "Round Service" as RoundService
	component "Round Store (Lua)\nopen-rounds / submit-answer / close-rounds" as RoundStore
	component "Activity Snapshot\nrounds[] (open + closed)" as Snapshot
	component "Activity SSE + Projection\n(per-round privacy)" as Sync
}

database "Private Redis\nactivity.openRoundIdsByQuestion\nround:{id}:* per question" as Redis

Teacher --> BoardUI : select questions, open, close one / all, write back
Student --> StudentUI : answer every open question separately
BoardUI --> Reducer : apply SSE events / API results
StudentUI --> Reducer : apply SSE events
StudentUI --> StudentApi : submit answers[] per round
BoardUI --> OpenAPI : open selected (atomic)
BoardUI --> CloseAPI : close one round
BoardUI --> CloseAllAPI : close every open round
BoardUI --> WritebackAPI : write back / retry failed
StudentApi --> SubmitAPI : POST answers[]
StudentApi --> Sync : EventSource
OpenAPI --> RoundService
CloseAPI --> RoundService
CloseAllAPI --> RoundService
SubmitAPI --> RoundService
RoundService --> RoundStore
RoundStore --> Redis : all-or-nothing state change + one event per round
Snapshot --> Redis : load every round of the activity
Sync --> Snapshot : reconnect snapshot
Sync --> Redis : read event Stream
Sync --> BoardUI : phase.changed / submission.accepted / results.finalized / writeback.status
Sync --> StudentUI : phase.changed / own receipt / results.finalized

note bottom of Redis
	openRoundIdsByQuestion maps question number -> open round id.
	It is a JSON object (never an empty array) and is removed
	when no round is open. Each question has at most one round;
	order, winner and submissions stay per round.
end note
@enduml
